Description:\uc0\u8232 \u8232 KalyanSarathi is an android application that creates a bilingual interface (English and Hindi) to advise users on government schemes they are eligible for. The application, will use a Gemini API and will first ask the user a series of question and then input it into the Gemini Prompt, which will be given I this document Additionally, it should consist of Text to Speech (TTS) and Speech to Text (STT) facilities, so that users can interact with the bot with audio.\
