\cf4 Based on all these factors, the following prompt is given to the Gemini API:\cb1 \uc0\u8232 \u8232 \cb3 Using gender, living area: @workflow.occupation, Caste, Age, Minority Religion Status, state, Income in Rupees,\'a0 advise central and state government schemes in India that a user would be eligible for. Also, suggest links to where a person can apply for these schemes. Keep the text short and recommend a minimum of 5 schemes and a maximum of 8 schemes. Ensure that the language of suggestion is in the initial language selected.. Ensure that the scheme descriptions provide the user with step through which they can apply for the scheme in addition to a general description. Include links to sites where they can apply online. Give step by step instructions including required documents, and the exact form they have to fill.\cf2 \
\cf4 \'a0\cf2 \
